---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop">
  <Header />
  <main class="pt-24">
    <section class="py-20 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
      <p class="text-wood text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Our Story</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl text-darkwood mb-8">Creating Beautiful Cabinetry Since 1967</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
        <p>Snitz Creek Cabinet Shop began over fifty years ago in a converted chicken house on a farm along the Snitz Creek in Lebanon, Pennsylvania. What started as a passion for creating elegance in homes has grown into a local icon for fine custom cabinetry.</p>
        <p>The tradition of hand-crafted cabinets from solid wood remains at the heart of what we do. As a family-owned and operated company, our reputation has spread throughout the region, and the demand for excellent cabinetry has grown well beyond the grassy banks of Snitz Creek.</p>
        <p>We take pride in our quality and design. Each year more people choose Snitz Creek to enhance the beauty of their kitchens, baths, and entertainment areas. In 2007 and 2008 we were honored with the prestigious LCBA Award for kitchen remodels and additions.</p>
        <p>Today we continue the same commitment: blending the precision of computerized equipment with the care of traditional hand skills.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Snitz Green Story -->
      <div class="mt-20 pt-12 border-t border-wood/20">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-6">Snitz Green</h2>
        
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start mb-8">
          <!-- Drone photo placeholder — replace src with actual image URL -->
          <img 
            src="https://snitzcreek.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Lynn-Reisinger-.jpg" 
            alt="Aerial view of the land" 
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded"
          />
          <div class="prose prose-lg text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Green is more than a color — it’s a commitment to the land that has been part of our family for generations. From the banks of Snitz Creek to the fields around the shop, we’ve always believed in working with nature, not against it.</p>
            <p>The same care we put into every cabinet is the care we put into the ground we stand on.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-start">
          <div class="prose prose-lg text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Holding the earth in our hands is a reminder of the responsibility we have to the next generation — to leave the land better than we found it, and to build things that last.</p>
          </div>
          <!-- Earth in hands photo placeholder — replace src with actual image URL -->
          <img 
            src="https://snitzcreek.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/Giannini-3.jpg" 
            alt="Hands holding the earth" 
            class="w-full h-auto object-cover rounded"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-16 pt-12 border-t border-wood/20">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-darkwood mb-6">Also from Snitz Creek</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-6">
          <a href="https://www.instagram.com/snitzgreen" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wood hover:text-darkwood text-lg font-medium">Snitz Green on Instagram</a>
          <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@snitzcreektv" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-wood hover:text-darkwood text-lg font-medium">Snitz Creek TV</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
